      "created_at": "2014-02-04T19:42:36.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>If they are in the same sentence like that, it stands to reason that they would be selected at the same time, but usually it's not. Usually it's \"X deals the hero target with the highest HP 3 melee damge. X deals the hero target with the lowest HP 2 energy damage,\" which would make it 2 separate calculations.</p>",
