      "id": 89054,
      "name": "Mystic Lemur",
      "username": "Mystic_Lemur",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/cdc98d/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-02-06T02:09:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>And of that 5% (or 25%), how often does the damage trigger? And of those times, how often does the target with the highest hit points then have the possibility to become the target with the lowest hit points?</p><p>It's only important when it comes up. For some players, that will be 0% of the time.</p>",
      "post_number": 9,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T03:13:53.405Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
      "incoming_link_count": 0,
      "reads": 0,
